{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
5BSD runs OpenBSD PF and has no ipfw(8), so mpd5 is built without IPFW
support.  RADIUS attributes that need ipfw (mpd-table, mpd-filter, and
mpd-limit "pipe"/"queue" actions through dummynet) are not available;
mpd-limit "rate-limit" and "shape" actions use netgraph (ng_car) and
still work.  To put session addresses into pf tables, call
"pfctl -t TABLE -T add|delete" from "set iface up-script" and
"set iface down-script" scripts.

5BSD denies kldload after boot.  Preload the netgraph node modules mpd5
uses (for example ng_ppp, ng_pppoe, ng_mppc, ng_car, ng_nat) from
/boot/loader.conf if they are not compiled into the kernel.
EOM
}
